  "verseCount": 16,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "35",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JOB 35"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "35",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 35:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then Elihu said:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.35.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.35.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 35:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Do you think this is just?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.35.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.35.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 35:2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "You say, 'I am in the right, not God.'",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.35.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.35.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 35:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yet you ask him, 'What profit is it to me,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.35.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.35.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 35:3"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and what do I gain by not sinning?'",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.35.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.35.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 35:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"I would like to reply to you",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.35.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.35.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 35:4"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and to your friends with you.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.35.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.35.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 35:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Look up at the heavens and see;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.35.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.35.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 35:5"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "gaze at the clouds so high above you.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.35.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.35.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 35:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If you sin, how does that affect him?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.35.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.35.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 35:6"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "If your sins are many, what does that do to him?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.35.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.35.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 35:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If you are righteous, what do you give to him,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.35.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.35.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 35:7"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "or what does he receive from your hand?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.35.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.35.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 35:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Your wickedness only affects humans like yourself,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.35.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.35.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 35:8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and your righteousness only other people.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.35.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.35.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 35:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"People cry out under a load of oppression;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.35.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.35.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 35:9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "they plead for relief from the arm of the powerful.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.35.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.35.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 35:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But no one says, 'Where is God my Maker,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.35.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.35.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 35:10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "who gives songs in the night,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.35.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.35.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 35:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "who teaches us more than he teaches",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.35.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.35.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "the beasts of the earth",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.35.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.35.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 35:11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and makes us wiser than",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.35.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.35.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "the birds in the sky?'",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.35.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.35.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 35:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He does not answer when people cry out",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.35.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.35.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 35:12"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "because of the arrogance of the wicked.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.35.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.35.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 35:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Indeed, God does not listen to their empty plea;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.35.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.35.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 35:13"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "the Almighty pays no attention to it.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.35.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.35.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 35:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "How much less, then, will he listen",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.35.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.35.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 35:14"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "when you say that you do not see him,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.35.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.35.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "JOB 35:14"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "that your case is before him",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.35.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.35.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 35:14"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and you must wait for him,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.35.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.35.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 35:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and further, that his anger never punishes",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.35.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.35.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 35:15"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and he does not take the least notice of wickedness.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.35.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.35.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 35:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So Job opens his mouth with empty talk;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.35.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.35.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 35:16"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "without knowledge he multiplies words.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.35.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.35.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
